 "codigo": "SV015",
 "parte": 1,
 "titulo": "We counted four. Five voices answered 😨 Part 1 #horror #shorts",
 "capa": "FIVE VOICES ANSWERED",
 "descripcion": "A mountain hut in the Urals has three rules carved into its door. At 1:12 AM, Mira counted her group out loud.\n\n> Part 2: {when_next}.\nWould you have counted again?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "A hut in the Urals has rules carved in its door.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Nobody knows who carved them. They have been there for decades.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I'm Mira, twenty-six, a ski guide.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I know that pass. I have crossed it eleven times.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "In February, I took three friends over the pass.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then the wind turned, and we couldn't see our own skis.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "We found the hut just before dark, half buried in snow.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The door said: stay inside, count every hour, never answer a knock.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Pavel laughed at them. I didn't.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "We lit the stove, and I set an alarm for every hour.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "At 1:12 AM, I counted us out loud. Four.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then five voices answered. One of them was mine.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "Pavel stopped laughing. Nobody moved.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I opened the shutter a crack, with my flashlight.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Outside, fresh footprints led straight to the door.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Bare feet, in the snow, at forty below.",
   "pausa": 0.9
  },
  {
   "texto": "Whose feet? Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
